on the Intel(R) 82598EB,  82599,  X540  and  X550  Ethernet  Con‐
trollers.  The driver supports Jumbo Frames, TCP Segmentation Of‐
fload (TSO).  For questions related to hardware requirements, re‐
fer  to the documentation supplied with your Intel 10GbE adapter.
